","position":{"commit_sha":"01be3e0d14c7d1627695757df2317ec9c06a9e5a","position":"1795087503446184199-9ba14a99-7725-4525-92e2-8235b2d98dfb"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIGNNmnI/WYNJAOKH9yvo0l+tMYJR2tK2UV4H8ReXBQU5 rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com rotated-20260907"},{"content_hash":"6f73543607ab848f229cf35272d8e099b1cf43821ea4d15574d8c6bac5c5f2d8","event_uuid":"ac1165a3-9948-41dd-86d1-53f0d84fba7c","position":{"commit_sha":"7369d6f54c8119397e26c5eac1e890ba9ddf8bde","position":"1795087555110324520-ac1165a3-9948-41dd-86d1-53f0d84fba7c"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIGNNmnI/WYNJAOKH9yvo0l+tMYJR2tK2UV4H8ReXBQU5 rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com rotated-20260907"},{"content_hash":"406a4b1abb247bb6974bd81ed299ee8a91b6c5fd74b3c4db8c41645677f8d744","event_uuid":"c252509f-8292-4772-a4fb-ed2b5b283b01","position":{"commit_sha":"3ef6ef80240e7ab486a1454cb05df2d09064a8df","position":"1795087563637733862-c252509f-8292-4772-a4fb-ed2b5b283b01"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIGNNmnI/WYNJAOKH9yvo0l+tMYJR2tK2UV4H8ReXBQU5 rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com rotated-20260907"}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"close_class":"duplicate","comments":[],"completion_expectation":"disposition","created_at":1795087213918982666,"creation_channel":"mcp","deps":[{"link_uuid":"9ba14a99-7725-4525-92e2-8235b2d98dfb","relation":"duplicates","target_id":"3e8c-b2fc-d34e-4a36"}],"description":"## Observation\nThe `sweep (windows)` jobs of runs 44487190183 (job 135433617476) and 44503581058 (job 135490319213, main at 92d3f373e2c) fail both cases of `tests/unit/test_git_ssh_output_encoding.py::test_run_git_encodes_str_stdin_as_utf8` (`[subprocess-run]` and `[process-group]`). The test and the product change it covers were added by 04e175d70eb (livid-painful-mosquito, closed). `gitutil.run_git(repo, 'hash-object', '--stdin', input_data='caf\u00e9 \u2713\\n')` returned `550e37cbee00c5f27e69148954b33e5b7ddb57f0`. The expected value, from bytes written directly, is `6b2b281e1146f9673f218f9c76042db37be95d03`.\n\n## Root cause (confirmed by hash)\n`550e37cb\u2026` is the git blob hash of `caf\u00e9 \u2713\\r\\n`, and `6b2b281e\u2026` is the hash of `caf\u00e9 \u2713\\n` (both computed locally with sha1 over `blob <len>\\0<bytes>`). In text mode, `subprocess` wraps the child's stdin in an `io.TextIOWrapper` with default newline handling, which writes every `\\n` as `os.linesep` (`\\r\\n` on Windows). So on Windows, every `run_git` call that passes a `str` to stdin in text mode sends CRLF to git. That changes object hashes for `hash-object`/`mktree`/`commit-tree`-style input, and it changes any newline-delimited stdin protocol. The UTF-8 encoding added by 04e175d70eb is correct; this is a separate newline defect that the new test exposed.\n\n## Approach\nIn text mode, encode `str` stdin to UTF-8 bytes in `run_git` and write it in binary mode, while still decoding stdout/stderr as UTF-8 text. That keeps the `text=True` return contract and stops newline translation. Check sibling helpers that pass `str` stdin in text mode (sshsig, other `subprocess.run(..., input=str, text=True)` sites under src/rebar) for the same defect.\n\n## Acceptance criteria\n- [ ] `run_git` sends `str` stdin to git byte-for-byte as UTF-8, with no newline translation, on every platform.\n- [ ] A regression test that does not need Windows fails on the pre-fix code (for example by asserting the bytes reaching the child).\n- [ ] Both `test_run_git_encodes_str_stdin_as_utf8` cases pass in a `sweep (windows)` run on main after the fix (run id recorded in a comment).","env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"undeclared","keyring":[],"last_status_env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","managed_refs":[],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"ac1165a3-9948-41dd-86d1-53f0d84fba7c","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"releases":[],"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"closed","tags":["windows"],"ticket_id":"513b-5241-456e-4d7a","ticket_type":"bug","title":"run_git text-mode stdin turns \\n into \\r\\n on Windows","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["ff365bea-87b1-445a-bb28-60b48d7bade6","9ba14a99-7725-4525-92e2-8235b2d98dfb","ac1165a3-9948-41dd-86d1-53f0d84fba7c","c252509f-8292-4772-a4fb-ed2b5b283b01"]},"env_id":"","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1795087563637733863,"uuid":"05769e46-e4ba-403e-b54c-70fdffc15d7f"}
